{"title":"Hill Giant Youth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 13 Hill Giant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(88.3px,-71.2px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-2/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-2/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:-107.9px;top:60.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:-93.5px;top:60.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:-79.1px;top:61.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:-139.6px;top:83.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:-81.8px;top:85.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:-99.0px;top:73.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-88.0px;top:95.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:-146.4px;top:116.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:-148.5px;top:123.4px\"></i></div><figcapti